{
    "Download CyberChef": "下载 CyberChef",
    "Downloading CyberChef": "下载 CyberChef",
    "<p>CyberChef can be downloaded to run locally or hosted within your own network. It has no server-side component so all that is required is that the ZIP file is uncompressed and the files are accessible.</p><p>As a user, it is worth noting that unofficial versions of CyberChef could have been modified to introduce Input and/or Recipe exfiltration. We recommend always using the official, open source, up-to-date version of CyberChef hosted at <a href='https://gchq.github.io/CyberChef'>https://gchq.github.io/CyberChef</a> if accessible.</p><p>The Network tab in your browser's Developer console (F12) can be used to inspect the network requests made by a website. This can confirm that no data is uploaded when a CyberChef recipe is baked.</p>": "<p>CyberChef 可以下载后在本地运行,或部署在你自己的网络内。它没有服务端组件,只需解压 ZIP 文件并让文件可访问即可。</p><p>作为用户需要注意,非官方版本的 CyberChef 可能已被修改以窃取输入或配方数据。如果条件允许,建议始终使用官方、开源、最新的版本:<a href='https://gchq.github.io/CyberChef'>https://gchq.github.io/CyberChef</a>。</p><p>可以使用浏览器开发者工具(F12)中的\"网络\"标签页检查网站发出的网络请求,以确认 CyberChef 烘焙配方时没有上传任何数据。</p>",
    "Edit favourites": "编辑收藏",
    "Edit Favourites": "编辑收藏",
    "JavaScript is not enabled. Good luck.": "未启用 JavaScript。祝你好运。",
    "Baking time": "烘焙耗时",
    "Replace input with output": "用输出替换输入",
    "Loading animation": "加载动画",
    "This loading animation shows an accurate representation of how rotors moved on The Bombe, an electro-mechanical device built at Bletchley Park in 1939 by Alan Turing with refinements by Gordon Welchman in 1940. The Bombe was used by the Government Code and Cipher School (the precursor to GCHQ) to discover daily settings of Enigma machines used by the German military in World War 2.<br><br>More information can be found on <a href='https://wikipedia.org/wiki/Bombe'>Wikipedia</a>.": "这个加载动画准确展示了 Bombe 机转子的运动方式。Bombe 是 Alan Turing 于 1939 年在布莱切利园制造的机电装置,1940 年经 Gordon Welchman 改进。政府密码学校(GCHQ 的前身)曾用它破译二战期间德军恩尼格玛机的每日设置。<br><br>更多信息见<a href='https://wikipedia.org/wiki/Bombe'>维基百科</a>。",
    "The MCP management panel connects to the CyberChef MCP service to choose which CyberChef operations are exposed to AI agents, and to inspect their call history. The four built-in MCP tools are always available.": "MCP 管理面板连接 CyberChef 的 MCP 服务,用于选择对 AI agent 开放哪些 CyberChef 操作,并查看它们的调用历史。4 个内置 MCP 工具始终可用。",
    "Options": "选项",
    "Options and Settings": "选项与设置",
    "Configurable options to change how CyberChef behaves. These settings are stored in your browser's local storage, meaning they will persist between sessions that use the same browser profile.": "用于调整 CyberChef 行为的配置项。这些设置保存在浏览器的本地存储中,同一浏览器配置文件的会话之间会保留。",
    "About / Support": "关于 / 支持",
    "About / Support ": "关于 / 支持 ",
    "This pane provides information about the CyberChef web app, how to use some of the features, and how to raise bug reports.": "此面板提供 CyberChef 网页应用的相关信息、部分功能的使用说明,以及如何提交 bug 报告。",
    "Operations": "操作",
    "Operations list": "操作列表",
    "<p>The Operations list contains all the operations in CyberChef arranged into categories. Some operations may be present in multiple categories. You can search for operations using the search box.</p><p>To use an operation, either double click it, or drag it into the Recipe pane. You will then be able to configure its arguments (or 'Ingredients' in CyberChef terminology).</p>": "<p>操作列表按分类列出了 CyberChef 中的全部操作,某些操作可能同时属于多个分类。你可以使用搜索框搜索操作。</p><p>要使用某个操作,双击它,或将其拖入配方面板。之后即可配置它的参数(CyberChef 术语中称为\"原料 Ingredient\")。</p>",
    "Search...": "搜索……",
    "Searching for operations": "搜索操作",
    "<p>Use the search box to find useful operations.</p><p>Both operation names and descriptions are queried using a fuzzy matching algorithm.</p>": "<p>使用搜索框查找有用的操作。</p><p>搜索会通过模糊匹配算法同时查询操作名称和描述(支持中英文)。</p>",
    "Recipe": "配方",
    "Recipe pane": "配方面板",
    "<p>The Recipe pane is where your chosen Operations are configured. If you are a programmer, think of these as functions. If you are not a programmer, these are like steps in a cake recipe. The Input data will be processed based on the Operations in your Recipe.</p><ul><li>To reorder, simply drag and drop the Operations into the order your require</li><li>To remove an operation, either double click it, or drag it outside of the Recipe pane</li></ul><p>The arguments (or 'Ingredients' in CyberChef terminology) can be configured to change how an Operation processes the data.</p>": "<p>配方面板用于配置你选择的操作。如果你是程序员,可以把它们理解为函数;如果不是,可以把它理解为蛋糕食谱中的步骤。输入数据将按照配方中的操作依次处理。</p><ul><li>要调整顺序,直接拖拽操作即可</li><li>要移除操作,双击它,或将其拖出配方面板</li></ul><p>参数(CyberChef 术语中的\"原料\")可以配置,以改变操作处理数据的方式。</p>",
    "Hide arguments": "收起参数",
    "Hiding every Operation's argument view in a Recipe": "收起配方中所有操作的参数",
    "Clicking 'Hide arguments' will hide all the argument views for every Operation in the Recipe, to save space when you have too many Operation in your Recipe": "点击\"收起参数\"会隐藏配方中所有操作的参数视图,在配方操作过多时节省空间",
    "Save recipe": "保存配方",
    "Saving a recipe": "保存配方",
    "<p>Recipes can be represented in a few different formats and saved for use at a later date. You can either copy the Recipe configuration and save it somewhere offline for later use, or use your browser's local storage.</p><ul><li><b>Deep link:</b> The easiest way to share a CyberChef Recipe is to copy the deep link, either from the address bar (which is updated as the Recipe or Input changes), or from the 'Save recipe' pane. When you visit this link, the Recipe and Input will be populated from where you left off.</li><li><b>Chef format:</b> This custom format is designed to be compact and easily readable. It is the format used in CyberChef's URL, so it largely uses characters that do not have to be escaped in URL encoding, making it a little easier to understand what a CyberChef URL contains.</li><li><b>Clean JSON:</b> This JSON format uses whitespace and indentation in a way that makes the Recipe easy to read.</li><li><b>Compact JSON:</b> This is the most compact way that the Recipe can be represented in JSON.</li><li><b>Local storage:</b> Alternatively, you can enter a name into the 'Recipe name' field and save to your browser's local storage. The Recipe will then be available to load from the 'Load Recipe' pane as long as you are using the same browser profile. Be aware that if your browser profile is cleaned, you may lose this data.</li></ul>": "<p>配方可以以多种格式表示并保存,供以后使用。你可以把配方配置复制到其他地方离线保存,或使用浏览器的本地存储。</p><ul><li><b>深度链接:</b> 分享 CyberChef 配方最简单的方式是复制深度链接,可以从地址栏(会随配方或输入的变化而更新)或\"保存配方\"面板中获取。访问该链接时,配方和输入会自动恢复。</li><li><b>Chef 格式:</b> 此自定义格式紧凑且易读,是 CyberChef URL 使用的格式,主要使用无需 URL 编码转义的字符,便于理解 CyberChef URL 的内容。</li><li><b>规整 JSON:</b> 此 JSON 格式使用空白和缩进,便于阅读。</li><li><b>紧凑 JSON:</b> 配方最紧凑的 JSON 表示。</li><li><b>本地存储:</b> 也可以在\"配方名称\"字段输入名称,保存到浏览器本地存储。之后只要使用同一浏览器配置文件,即可在\"加载配方\"面板中加载。注意:如果浏览器配置文件被清理,数据可能丢失。</li></ul>",
    "Load recipe": "加载配方",
    "Loading a recipe": "加载配方",
    "<p>Saved recipes can be loaded using one of the following methods:</p><ul><li>If you have a CyberChef deep link, simply visit that link and the Recipe and Input will be populated automatically.</li><li>If you have a Recipe string in any of the accepted formats, paste it into the 'Load recipe' pane textbox and click 'Load'.</li><li>If you have saved a Recipe to your browser's local storage, it should be available in the dropdown menu in the 'Load recipe' pane. If it is not there, you may not be using the same browser profile, or your profile may have been cleared.</li></ul>": "<p>已保存的配方可通过以下方式加载:</p><ul><li>如果你有 CyberChef 深度链接,直接访问该链接,配方和输入会自动填充。</li><li>如果你有任意受支持格式的配方字符串,将其粘贴到\"加载配方\"面板的文本框中并点击\"加载\"。</li><li>如果你把配方保存到了浏览器本地存储,它应出现在\"加载配方\"面板的下拉菜单中。如果没有,可能是你未使用同一浏览器配置文件,或配置文件已被清空。</li></ul>",
    "Clear recipe": "清空配方",
    "Clearing a recipe": "清空配方",
    "Clicking the 'Clear recipe' button will remove all operations from the Recipe. It will not clear the Input, but it will trigger a Bake if Auto-bake is turned on, which will change the value of the Output.": "点击\"清空配方\"按钮会移除配方中的所有操作。它不会清空输入,但如果开启了自动烘焙,会触发一次烘焙,从而改变输出的值。",
    "Step": "单步",
    "Step through the recipe": "单步执行配方",
    "Stepping through the Recipe": "单步执行配方",
    "<p>The Step button allows you to execute one operation at a time, rather than running the whole Recipe from beginning to end.</p><p>Step allows you to inspect the data at each stage of the Recipe and understand what is being passed to the next operation.</p>": "<p>\"单步\"按钮允许一次只执行一个操作,而不是从头到尾运行整个配方。</p><p>单步执行可以查看配方每个阶段的数据,了解传递给下一个操作的内容。</p>",
    "Bake!": "烘焙!",
    "<p>Baking causes CyberChef to run the Recipe against your data. This involves three steps:</p><ol><li>The data in the Input is encoded into bytes using the character encoding selected in the Input status bar.</li><li>The data is run through each of the operations in the Recipe in turn with the output of one operation being fed into the next operation as its input.</li><li>The outcome of the final operation in the Recipe is decoded into Output text using the character encoding selected in the Output status bar.</li></ol><p>If there are multiple Inputs, the Bake button causes every Input to be baked simultaneously.</p>": "<p>烘焙会让 CyberChef 对你的数据运行配方,包括三个步骤:</p><ol><li>输入中的数据按输入状态栏所选的字符编码编码为字节。</li><li>数据依次流经配方中的每个操作,前一个操作的输出作为下一个操作的输入。</li><li>配方中最后一个操作的结果按输出状态栏所选的字符编码解码为输出文本。</li></ol><p>如果有多个输入,烘焙按钮会同时烘焙所有输入。</p>",
    "Auto Bake": "自动烘焙",
    "Auto-bake": "自动烘焙",
    "<p>When Auto-bake is turned on, CyberChef will bake the Input using the Recipe whenever anything in the Input or Recipe changes.</p>This includes:<ul><li>Adding or removing operations</li><li>Modifying operation arguments</li><li>Editing the Input</li><li>Changing the Input character encoding</li></ul><p>If there are multiple inputs, only the currently active tab will be baked when Auto-bake triggers. You can bake all inputs manually using the Bake button.</p>": "<p>开启自动烘焙后,只要输入或配方发生任何变化,CyberChef 都会立即用配方烘焙输入。</p>包括:<ul><li>添加或移除操作</li><li>修改操作参数</li><li>编辑输入</li><li>更改输入字符编码</li></ul><p>如果有多个输入,自动烘焙触发时只烘焙当前活动的标签页。可以使用烘焙按钮手动烘焙全部输入。</p>",
    "Input": "输入",
    "Input pane": "输入面板",
    "<p>Input data can be entered by typing it in, pasting it in, dragging it in, or using the 'Load file' or 'Load folder' buttons.</p><p>CyberChef does its best to represent data as accurately as possible to ensure you know exactly what you are working with. Non-printable characters are represented using control character pictures, for example a null byte (0x00) is displayed like this: <span title='Control character null' aria-label='Control character null' class='cm-specialChar'>␀</span>.</p>": "<p>输入数据可以通过键入、粘贴、拖入,或使用\"打开文件\"/\"打开文件夹\"按钮载入。</p><p>CyberChef 尽最大努力精确地表示数据,确保你确切知道自己正在处理的内容。不可打印字符使用控制字符图形表示,例如空字节(0x00)显示为:<span title='控制字符 null' aria-label='控制字符 null' class='cm-specialChar'>␀</span>。</p>",
    "Add a new input tab": "新建输入标签页",
    "Tabs": "标签页",
    "<p>New tabs can be created to support multiple Inputs. These tabs have their own associated character encodings and EOL separators, as defined in their status bars.</p><p>The deep link in the URL bar only contains information about the currently active tab.</p>": "<p>可以新建标签页以支持多个输入。每个标签页有各自独立的字符编码和换行符,显示在各自的状态栏中。</p><p>地址栏中的深度链接只包含当前活动标签页的信息。</p>",
    "Open folder as input": "打开文件夹作为输入",
    "Opening a folder": "打开文件夹",
    "<p>You can open a whole folder into CyberChef, which will result in each file being loaded into a separate Input tab.</p><p>CyberChef can handle lots of Input files, but be aware that performance may suffer, especially if the files are large in size.</p><p>Folders can also be loaded by dragging them over the Input pane and dropping them.</p>": "<p>可以把整个文件夹打开到 CyberChef 中,其中每个文件会分别加载到一个输入标签页。</p><p>CyberChef 可以处理大量输入文件,但性能可能下降,尤其是文件较大时。</p><p>也可以把文件夹拖到输入面板上放开来加载。</p>",
    "Open file as input": "打开文件作为输入",
    "Opening a file": "打开文件",
    "<p>Files can be loaded into CyberChef individually or in groups, either using the 'Open file as input' button, or by dragging and dropping them over the Input pane.</p><p>CyberChef can handle reasonably large files (at least 500MB, depending on hardware), but performance may be impacted and some Operations will run very slowly over large Inputs.</p>": "<p>文件可以单独或成组载入 CyberChef,可以使用\"打开文件作为输入\"按钮,也可以直接把文件拖放到输入面板上。</p><p>CyberChef 可以处理相当大的文件(至少 500MB,取决于硬件),但性能可能受影响,某些操作处理大输入时会非常慢。</p>",
    "Clear input and output": "清空输入和输出",
    "Clearing the Input and Output": "清空输入与输出",
    "Clicking the 'Clear input and output' button will remove all Inputs and Outputs. It will not clear the Recipe.": "点击\"清空输入和输出\"按钮会移除所有输入和输出,但不会清空配方。",
    "Reset pane layout": "重置面板布局",
    "Resetting the pane layout": "重置面板布局",
    "CyberChef's panes can be resized to suit your area of focus. This button will reset the pane sizes to their default configuration.": "CyberChef 的各面板可以调整大小以适应你的关注点。此按钮会把面板尺寸重置为默认配置。",
    "Go to tab": "跳转到标签页",
    "Find tab": "查找标签页",
    "Close all tabs": "关闭所有标签页",
    "Output": "输出",
    "Output pane": "输出面板",
    "<p>This pane displays the results of the Recipe after it has processed your Input.</p><p>CyberChef does its best to represent data as accurately as possible to ensure you know exactly what you are working with. Non-printable characters are represented using control character pictures, for example a null byte (0x00) is displayed like this: <span title='Control character null' aria-label='Control character null' class='cm-specialChar'>␀</span>.</p><p>When copying these characters from the Output, the original byte value will be copied into your clipboard, rather than the control character picture itself.</p>": "<p>此面板显示配方处理输入后的结果。</p><p>CyberChef 尽最大努力精确地表示数据,确保你确切知道自己正在处理的内容。不可打印字符使用控制字符图形表示,例如空字节(0x00)显示为:<span title='控制字符 null' aria-label='控制字符 null' class='cm-specialChar'>␀</span>。</p><p>从输出复制这些字符时,复制到剪贴板的是原始字节值,而不是控制字符图形本身。</p>",
    "Save all outputs to a zip file": "将所有输出保存为 zip 文件",
    "Saving all outputs to a zip file": "将所有输出保存为 zip 文件",
    "<p>When operating with multiple tabbed Inputs and Outputs, you can use this button to save off all the Outputs at once in a ZIP file.</p><p>Use the 'Bake' button to bake all Inputs at once.</p><p>You will be given the choice to specify the file extension for the Outputs, or you can let CyberChef attempt to detect the filetype of each one. If an Output's type is not clear, CyberChef will use the '.dat' extension.</p>": "<p>使用多个标签页输入/输出时,可用此按钮把所有输出一次性保存为一个 ZIP 文件。</p><p>使用\"烘焙\"按钮可一次烘焙全部输入。</p><p>你可以指定输出的文件扩展名,也可以让 CyberChef 尝试检测每个文件的类型。如果输出类型不明确,CyberChef 会使用 '.dat' 扩展名。</p>",
    "save": "保存",
    "Save output to file": "保存输出到文件",
    "Saving output to a file": "保存输出到文件",
    "The currently active Output can be saved to a file. You will be asked to specify a filename. CyberChef will attempt to guess the correct file extension based on the data. If a file type cannot be detected, the extension defaults to '.dat' but can be changed manually.": "当前活动的输出可以保存为文件,会要求你指定文件名。CyberChef 会尝试根据数据猜测正确的文件扩展名;如果无法检测文件类型,默认使用 '.dat',也可以手动修改。",
    "copy content": "复制内容",
    "Copy raw output to the clipboard": "复制原始输出到剪贴板",
    "Copying raw output to the clipboard": "复制原始输出到剪贴板",
    "<p>Data can be copied from the Output in the normal way by selecting text and copying it. This button provides a quick way of copying the entire output to the clipboard without having to select it. It directly copies the raw data rather than selecting text in the Output editor. Each method will have the same result, but the button may be more efficient for large Outputs as it does not require any DOM interaction.</p>": "<p>可以从输出中以常规方式选中文本复制。此按钮提供了一种无需选中即可把整个输出复制到剪贴板的快捷方式,它直接复制原始数据而不是在输出编辑器中选中文本。两种方式结果相同,但对于大输出,按钮方式不涉及 DOM 操作,可能更高效。</p>",
    "replace input with output": "用输出替换输入",
    "Replacing input with output": "用输出替换输入",
    "<p>This button moves the currently active Output data into the currently active Input tab, overwriting whatever data was already there.</p><p>The Input character encoding and EOL sequence will be changed to match the current Output values, so that the data is interpreted correctly.</p>": "<p>此按钮把当前活动的输出数据移动到当前活动的输入标签页,覆盖其中已有的数据。</p><p>输入的字符编码和换行符会更改为与当前输出一致,以确保数据被正确解析。</p>",
    "maximise output pane": "最大化输出面板",
    "Maximise output pane": "最大化输出面板",
    "Maximising the Output pane": "最大化输出面板",
    "This button allows you to view the Output pane at maximum size, hiding the Operations, Recipe and Input panes. You can restore the pane to its normal size by clicking the same button again.": "此按钮可以把输出面板放大到最大尺寸,隐藏操作、配方和输入面板。再次点击同一按钮可恢复常规尺寸。",
    "<p>One of CyberChef's best features is its ability to automatically detect which Operations might make more sense of your data. The Magic button appears when CyberChef has a suggested Operation for you based on the data in the Output.</p><p>Clicking on the button will add the suggested Operation(s) to your Recipe.</p><p>This background Magic detection will inspect your Output up to three levels deep and attempt to unwrap it using a range of techniques. For more control, use the 'Magic' operation, which allows you to configure greater depth and filter based on various parameters.</p><p>Further information about CyberChef Magic can be found <a href='https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef/wiki/Automatic-detection-of-encoded-data-using-CyberChef-Magic'>here</a>.</p>": "<p>CyberChef 最出色的功能之一是自动检测哪些操作可能让你的数据更有意义。当 CyberChef 基于输出数据有推荐操作时,就会出现 Magic 按钮。</p><p>点击该按钮会把推荐的操作添加到配方中。</p><p>后台 Magic 检测最多会检查输出三层深度,并尝试用多种技术解包。如需更多控制,请使用 'Magic' 操作,它可以配置更大的深度并按多种参数过滤。</p><p>有关 CyberChef Magic 的更多信息请见<a href='https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef/wiki/Automatic-detection-of-encoded-data-using-CyberChef-Magic'>此处</a>。</p>",
    "The output is stale. The input or recipe has changed since this output was generated. Bake again to get the new value.": "输出已过期。生成此输出后输入或配方已发生变化。请重新烘焙以获取新值。",
    "Staleness indicator": "过期指示器",
    "The staleness indicator is displayed when the Recipe or Input has changed but the Output has not yet been updated to reflect this. It is most commonly displayed when Auto-bake is turned off and indicates that you need to Bake in order to see an accurate Output.": "当配方或输入已变化但输出尚未更新时,会显示过期指示器。最常见于关闭自动烘焙时,提示你需要烘焙才能看到准确的输出。",
    "Save recipe ": "保存配方 ",
    "Chef format": "Chef 格式",
    "Clean JSON": "规整 JSON",
    "Compact JSON": "紧凑 JSON",
    "Recipe name": "配方名称",
    "Save your recipe to local storage using this name, or copy it to load later": "使用此名称将配方保存到本地存储,或复制下来稍后加载",
    "Save": "保存",
