    "Reset favourites to default": "重置为默认收藏",
    "CyberChef - The Cyber Swiss Army Knife": "CyberChef——网络瑞士军刀",
    "FAQs": "常见问题",
    "Report a bug": "报告 bug",
    "About": "关于",
    "Keybindings": "快捷键",
    "FAQ pane": "常见问题面板",
    "The Frequently Asked Questions pane provides answers to some of the most common queries people have about CyberChef.": "常见问题面板解答了大家对 CyberChef 最常见的一些疑问。",
    "How does X feature work?": "某个功能是怎么用的?",
    "CyberChef has a contextual help feature. Just hover your cursor over a feature that you want to learn more about and press <code>F1</code> on your keyboard to get some information about it. Give it a try by hovering over this text and pressing <code>F1</code> now!": "CyberChef 有上下文帮助功能。把光标悬停在你想了解的功能上,按键盘上的 <code>F1</code> 即可查看相关说明。现在就把光标悬停在这段文字上按 <code>F1</code> 试试吧!",
    "What sort of things can I do with CyberChef?": "CyberChef 能做些什么?",
    "There are <span class=\"num-ops\">hundreds of</span> operations in CyberChef allowing you to carry out simple and complex tasks easily. Here are some examples:": "CyberChef 内置<span class=\"num-ops\">数百个</span>操作,让你轻松完成简单或复杂的任务。以下是一些例子:",
    "Decode a Base64-encoded string": "解码 Base64 编码的字符串",
    "Convert a date and time to a different time zone": "把日期时间转换到其他时区",
    "Parse a Teredo IPv6 address": "解析 Teredo IPv6 地址",
    "Convert data from a hexdump, then decompress": "先从 hexdump 转换数据,再解压",
    "Decrypt and disassemble shellcode": "解密并反汇编 shellcode",
    "Display multiple timestamps as full dates": "把多个时间戳显示为完整日期",
    "Carry out different operations on data of different types": "对不同类型的数据执行不同操作",
    "Use parts of the input as arguments to operations": "把输入的一部分用作操作参数",
    "Can I load input directly from files?": "可以直接从文件加载输入吗?",
    "Yes! Just drag your file over the input box and drop it.": "可以!把文件拖到输入框上放开即可。",
    "CyberChef can handle files up to around 2GB (depending on your browser), however some of the operations may take a very long time to run over this much data.": "CyberChef 可以处理最大约 2GB 的文件(取决于浏览器),但某些操作处理这么大的数据可能需要很长时间。",
    "If the output is larger than a certain threshold (default <a href=\"#recipe=Multiply('Line%20feed')Convert_data_units('Bytes%20(B)','Mebibytes%20(MiB)')&input=MTAyNAoxMDI0\">1MiB</a>), it will be presented to you as a file available for download. Slices of the file can be viewed in the output if you need to inspect them.": "如果输出超过一定阈值(默认 <a href=\"#recipe=Multiply('Line%20feed')Convert_data_units('Bytes%20(B)','Mebibytes%20(MiB)')&input=MTAyNAoxMDI0\">1MiB</a>),会以可下载文件的形式呈现。需要时可分段查看文件内容。",
    "How do I run operation X over multiple inputs at once?": "怎么对多个输入同时运行某个操作?",
    "Maybe you have 10 timestamps that you want to parse or 16 encoded strings that all have the same key.": "假如你有 10 个要解析的时间戳,或 16 个使用同一密钥的编码字符串。",
    "The 'Fork' operation (found in the 'Flow control' category) splits up the input line by line and runs all subsequent operations on each line separately. Each output is then displayed on a separate line. These delimiters can be changed, so if your inputs are separated by commas, you can change the split delimiter to a comma instead.": "\"分流\"操作(位于\"流程控制\"分类)会按行拆分输入,并对每一行分别运行后续所有操作,每个输出各占一行。分隔符可以修改,比如输入以逗号分隔时,可以把拆分分隔符改成逗号。",
    "Click here": "点击这里",
    "How does the 'Magic' operation work?": "\"Magic\" 操作是怎么工作的?",
    "The 'Magic' operation uses a number of methods to detect encoded data and the operations which can be used to make sense of it. A technical description of these methods can be found <a href=\"https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef/wiki/Automatic-detection-of-encoded-data-using-CyberChef-Magic\">here</a>.": "\"Magic\" 操作使用多种方法检测已编码的数据以及可用于解读它的操作。这些方法的技术说明见<a href=\"https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef/wiki/Automatic-detection-of-encoded-data-using-CyberChef-Magic\">此处</a>。",
    "If you find a bug in CyberChef, please raise an issue in our GitHub repository explaining it in as much detail as possible. Copy and include the following information if relevant.": "如果你发现了 CyberChef 的 bug,请到我们的 GitHub 仓库提交 issue,并尽可能详细地描述。如有帮助,请复制并附上以下信息。",
    "Raise issue on GitHub": "在 GitHub 上提交 issue",
    "What": "是什么",
    "A simple, intuitive web app for analysing and decoding data without having to deal with complex tools or programming languages. CyberChef encourages both technical and non-technical people to explore data formats, encryption and compression.": "一个简单直观的网页应用,无需应对复杂工具或编程语言即可分析和解码数据。CyberChef 鼓励技术人员和非技术人员探索数据格式、加密与压缩。",
    "Why": "为什么",
    "Digital data comes in all shapes, sizes and formats in the modern world – CyberChef helps to make sense of this data all on one easy-to-use platform.": "当今世界的数字数据形态、大小和格式千差万别——CyberChef 把这些数据的处理集中到一个易用的平台上。",
    "How": "怎么做",
    "The interface is designed with simplicity at its heart. Complex techniques are now as trivial as drag-and-drop. Simple functions can be combined to build up a \"recipe\", potentially resulting in complex analysis, which can be shared with other users and used with their input.": "界面设计以简洁为核心。复杂的技术如今像拖拽一样简单。简单功能可以组合成\"配方\",最终完成复杂分析,并可以分享给其他用户用于他们自己的输入。",
    "For those comfortable writing code, CyberChef is a quick and efficient way to prototype solutions to a problem which can then be scripted once proven to work.": "对会写代码的人来说,CyberChef 是快速高效的方案原型工具,验证可行后再脚本化。",
    "Who": "为谁做",
    "It is expected that CyberChef will be useful for cybersecurity and antivirus companies. It should also appeal to the academic world and any individuals or companies involved in the analysis of digital data, be that software developers, analysts, mathematicians or casual puzzle solvers.": "CyberChef 预期对网络安全和反病毒公司有用,也适合学术界以及任何从事数字数据分析的个人或公司——无论是软件开发者、分析师、数学家还是休闲解谜爱好者。",
    "Aim": "目标",
    "It is hoped that by releasing CyberChef through <a href=\"https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef\">GitHub</a>, contributions can be added which can be rolled out into future versions of the tool.": "希望通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef\">GitHub</a> 发布 CyberChef,接收贡献并融入未来版本。",
    "There are <span class=\"num-ops\">hundreds of</span> useful operations in CyberChef for anyone working on anything vaguely Internet-related, whether you just want to convert a timestamp to a different format, decompress gzipped data, create a SHA3 hash, or parse an X.509 certificate to find out who issued it.": "对于任何与互联网沾边的工作,CyberChef 都有<span class=\"num-ops\">数百个</span>实用操作——无论你是想把时间戳转换成其他格式、解压 gzip 数据、计算 SHA3 哈希,还是解析 X.509 证书看看签发者是谁。",
    "It’s the Cyber Swiss Army Knife.": "它就是网络瑞士军刀。",
    "Yes": "是",
    "No": "否",
