    "Content filter (regex)": "内容过滤(正则)",
    "Download CyberChef ": "下载 CyberChef ",
    "CyberChef runs entirely within your browser with no server-side component, meaning that your Input data and Recipe configuration are not sent anywhere, whether you use the live, official version of CyberChef or a downloaded, standalone version (assuming it is unmodified).": "CyberChef 完全在你的浏览器中运行,没有服务端组件,也就是说无论你使用在线官方版还是下载的独立版(前提是未经修改),你的输入数据和配方配置都不会被发送到任何地方。",
    "There are three operations that make calls to external services, those being the 'Show on map' operation which downloads map tiles from wikimedia.org, the 'DNS over HTTPS' operation which resolves DNS requests using either Google or Cloudflare services, and the 'HTTP request' operation that calls out to the configured URL you enter. You can confirm what network requests are made using your browser's developer console (F12) and viewing the Network tab.": "有三个操作会调用外部服务:\"在地图上显示\"操作会从 wikimedia.org 下载地图瓦片;\"DNS over HTTPS\" 操作使用 Google 或 Cloudflare 的服务解析 DNS 请求;\"HTTP 请求\" 操作会向你配置的 URL 发起请求。你可以用浏览器开发者控制台(F12)的\"网络\"标签页确认网站发出了哪些网络请求。",
    "If you would like to download your own standalone copy of CyberChef to run in a segregated network or where there is limited or no Internet connectivity, you can get a ZIP file containing the whole web app below. This can be run locally or hosted on a web server with no configuration required.": "如果你想下载自己的 CyberChef 独立副本,在隔离网络或互联网连接受限/无网络的环境中运行,可以在下方获取包含整个网页应用的 ZIP 文件。它可以本地运行,也可以无需任何配置地部署在 Web 服务器上。",
    "Be aware that the standalone version will never update itself, meaning it will not receive bug fixes or new features until you re-download newer versions manually.": "注意,独立版永远不会自动更新,也就是说在你手动重新下载新版本之前,它不会获得 bug 修复和新功能。",
    "The changelog for this version can be viewed": "此版本的更新日志见",
    "here": "此处",
    "Released under the Apache Licence, Version 2.0.": "基于 Apache Licence 2.0 发布。",
    "Released under the Apache Licence, Version 2.0": "基于 Apache Licence 2.0 发布",
    "Download ZIP file": "下载 ZIP 文件",
    "Ok": "确定",
    "Set breakpoint": "设置断点",
    "Setting breakpoints": "设置断点",
    "Setting a breakpoint on an operation will cause execution of the Recipe to pause when it reaches that operation.": "在某个操作上设置断点后,配方执行到该操作时会暂停。",
    "Disable operation": "禁用操作",
    "Disabling operations": "禁用操作",
    "Disabling an operation will prevent it from being executed when the Recipe is baked. Execution will skip over the disabled operation and continue with subsequent operations.": "禁用某个操作后,烘焙配方时将跳过该操作,不会执行,继续执行后续操作。",
    "Hide operation's arguments": "收起参数",
    "Hiding an operation's argument will save space in the Recipe window. Execution will still take place with the selected argument options.": "收起操作的参数可以节省配方窗口的空间。操作仍会按所选的参数执行。",
    "More Information": "更多信息",
    "Your security settings do not allow access to local storage so your favourites cannot be saved.": "你的安全设置不允许访问本地存储,无法保存收藏。",
    "Your security settings do not allow access to local storage so your recipe cannot be saved.": "你的安全设置不允许访问本地存储,无法保存配方。",
    "Please enter a recipe name": "请输入配方名称",
    "Recipe saved as": "配方已保存为",
    "Invalid recipe": "无效的配方",
    "Loading...": "加载中……",
    "Cancel ": "取消 ",
    "is no longer available": "已不存在",
    "It has been removed from your favourites.": "已从你的收藏中移除。",
    "is no longer available.": "已不存在。",
    "This live version of CyberChef is updated whenever new commits are added to the master branch of the CyberChef repository. It represents the latest, most up-to-date build of CyberChef.": "此在线版 CyberChef 会在 CyberChef 仓库 master 分支有新提交时更新,代表最新、最及时的构建。",
    "is already in your favourites": "已在收藏中",
    "Favourite operations": "收藏的操作",
    "<p>This category displays your favourite operations.</p> <ul> <li><b>To add:</b> drag an operation over the Favourites category</li> <li><b>To reorder:</b> Click on the 'Edit favourites' button and drag operations up and down in the list provided</li> <li><b>To remove:</b> Click on the 'Edit favourites' button and hit the delete button next to the operation you want to remove</li> </ul>": "<p>此分类显示你收藏的操作。</p> <ul> <li><b>添加:</b> 将操作拖拽到\"收藏夹\"分类上</li> <li><b>排序:</b> 点击\"编辑收藏\"按钮,在列表中上下拖动操作</li> <li><b>删除:</b> 点击\"编辑收藏\"按钮,点击要删除的操作旁边的删除按钮</li> </ul>",
    "Last build:": "上次构建:",
    " ago": " 前",
    "Auto-Bake is disabled by default when using this operation.": "使用此操作时默认禁用自动烘焙。",
    "Input end of line separator has been detected and changed to": "检测到输入的换行符并已更改为",
    "Output end of line separator has been detected and changed to": "检测到输出的换行符并已更改为",
    "Output character encoding has been detected and changed to": "检测到输出的字符编码并已更改为",
    "Maximum line length exceeded. Word wrap will be temporarily disabled to improve performance.": "已超出最大行长。为提升性能,将临时禁用自动换行。",
    "Could not find any output data to download. Has this output been baked?": "找不到可下载的输出数据。此输出是否已烘焙?",
    "No filename was specified.": "未指定文件名。",
    "Could not find data to copy. Has this output been baked yet?": "找不到可复制的数据。此输出是否已烘焙?",
    "Copied raw output successfully.": "已成功复制原始输出。",
    "Sorry, the output could not be copied.": "抱歉,输出无法复制。",
    "Input status bar": "输入状态栏",
    "Output status bar": "输出状态栏",
    "This status bar provides information about data in the Input. Help topics are available for each of the components by activating help when hovering over them.": "此状态栏提供输入中数据的信息。将鼠标悬停在各组件上并激活帮助,可查看对应的帮助主题。",
    "This status bar provides information about data in the Output. Help topics are available for each of the components by activating help when hovering over them.": "此状态栏提供输出中数据的信息。将鼠标悬停在各组件上并激活帮助,可查看对应的帮助主题。",
    "Input length": "输入长度",
    "Output length": "输出长度",
    "This number represents the number of characters in the Input.<br><br>The CRLF end of line separator is counted as two characters which impacts this value.": "此数字表示输入中的字符数。<br><br>CRLF 换行符按两个字符计数,会影响此值。",
    "This number represents the number of characters in the Output.<br><br>The CRLF end of line separator is counted as two characters which impacts this value.": "此数字表示输出中的字符数。<br><br>CRLF 换行符按两个字符计数,会影响此值。",
    "Number of lines": "行数",
    "This number represents the number of lines in the Input. Lines are separated by the End of Line Sequence which can be changed using the EOL selector at the far right of this status bar.": "此数字表示输入中的行数。行由换行符分隔,可通过此状态栏最右侧的 EOL 选择器更改。",
    "This number represents the number of lines in the Output. Lines are separated by the End of Line Sequence which can be changed using the EOL selector at the far right of this status bar.": "此数字表示输出中的行数。行由换行符分隔,可通过此状态栏最右侧的 EOL 选择器更改。",
    "Main selection": "当前选区",
    "These numbers show which offsets have been selected and how many characters are in the current selection. If multiple selections are made, these numbers refer to the latest one.": "这些数字显示当前选区的起止偏移以及选中的字符数。如果进行了多重选择,显示的是最近一次选择的数值。",
    "Cursor offset": "光标偏移",
    "This number indicates what the current offset of the cursor is from the beginning of the Input.<br><br>The CRLF end of line separator is counted as two characters which impacts this value.": "此数字表示光标相对输入开头的当前偏移。<br><br>CRLF 换行符按两个字符计数,会影响此值。",
    "This number indicates what the current offset of the cursor is from the beginning of the Output.<br><br>The CRLF end of line separator is counted as two characters which impacts this value.": "此数字表示光标相对输出开头的当前偏移。<br><br>CRLF 换行符按两个字符计数,会影响此值。",
    "Baking time ": "烘焙耗时 ",
    "The baking time is the total time between data being read from the input, processed, and then displayed in the output.<br><br>The 'Threading overhead' value accounts for the transfer of data between different processing threads, as well as some garbage collection. It is not included in the overall bake time displayed in the status bar as it is largely influenced by background operating system and browser activity which can fluctuate significantly.": "烘焙耗时是指数据从输入读取、处理到显示在输出中的总时间。<br><br>\"线程开销\"值包含了数据在不同处理线程之间的传输以及部分垃圾回收的开销。它不计入状态栏显示的总烘焙时间,因为它主要受后台操作系统和浏览器活动的影响,波动可能很大。",
    "Input character encoding": "输入字符编码",
    "Output character encoding": "输出字符编码",
    "The input character encoding defines how the input text is encoded into bytes which are then processed by the Recipe.<br><br>The 'Raw bytes' option attempts to treat the input as individual bytes in the range 0-255. If it detects any characters with Unicode values above 255, it will treat the entire input as UTF-8. 'Raw bytes' is usually the best option if you are inputting binary data, such as a file.": "输入字符编码定义了输入文本如何被编码为字节并交给配方处理。<br><br>\"原始字节\"选项尝试把输入当作 0-255 范围内的单个字节处理。如果检测到任何 Unicode 值超过 255 的字符,则会把整个输入按 UTF-8 处理。输入二进制数据(如文件)时,\"原始字节\"通常是最佳选择。",
    "The output character encoding defines how the output bytes are decoded into text which can be displayed to you.<br><br>The 'Raw bytes' option treats the output data as individual bytes in the range 0-255.": "输出字符编码定义了输出字节如何被解码为可显示的文本。<br><br>\"原始字节\"选项把输出数据当作 0-255 范围内的单个字节处理。",
    "Raw Bytes": "原始字节",
    "Filter...": "过滤……",
    "Input EOL sequence": "输入换行符序列",
